---
/**
 * /mill-products/ — Titanium Mill Products Hub (Buyer Search Intelligence Phase G)
 *
 * Page role: Procurement Hub + Material Entity Hub for titanium mill products.
 * - 6 product forms (Bars/Rods, Plates/Sheets, Tubes/Pipes, Wire, Foil/Coils, Mesh)
 * - 5 grades (CP Grade 1, CP Grade 2, Ti-6Al-4V Grade 5, Ti-3Al-2.5V Grade 9, Ti-6Al-4V ELI Grade 23)
 * - 4 standard families (ASTM / AMS / ISO / MIL)
 * - Specification flow + Selection matrix + Value-added routing + Traceability +
 *   Certifications + Baoji sourcing + 5 Industry applications + Procurement info +
 *   8 FAQ + RFQ CTA
 *
 * Schema: pageType="products-hub" → CollectionPage + ItemList + Service + Article + FAQPage
 * No Product entity (single SKU model — only emit on per-form detail pages).
 *
 * Honest scope (方案 §10/11/14/23):
 * - No "BOZE-冶炼" claims — we are a sourcing + processing partner.
 * - No "100% Material Traceability" — "Full Material Traceability Available".
 * - No "Certified implant wire" — "medical material specifications where applicable".
 * - No mechanical Grade→Standard mapping.
 * - No "Quote within 24 hours" — neutral response language.
 *
 * Per Buyer-Search-Intelligence-SOP §5 forbidden patterns:
 * - No new component for a single page (F2).
 * - No q/a keys in faqItems (F3) — uses { question, answer }.
 * - No inline JSON-LD <script> blocks (F4) — only via BaseLayout buildPageGraph.
 * - All internal hrefs end with / (F9 trailing-slash mandate).
 * - No new URL paths invented — /mill-products/ was pre-reserved in NAVIGATION.
 */
